WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:03.253
♪♪

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:04.254
Cherry:
That's me.

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:05.797
♪♪

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:08.133
Cherry:
I'm 23 years old and...

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:12.387
♪♪

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:16.558
Cherry:
Somehow I'd always known that
this was how things were supposed to end.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:18.477
♪♪

00:00:18.477 --> 00:00:20.812
Anthony Russo:
Cherry is a very complicated
character.

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:23.440
Anthony Russo:
We focused on his life over
decades and

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.568
Anthony Russo:
wanted to find a way to convey
that, cinematically.

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:27.778
♪♪

00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:30.906
We're trying to tell a story
but there's so many moving
parts.

00:00:30.906 --> 00:00:32.866
Joe Russo: The movie is broken up into
chapters

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:36.203
to portray different experiences
this character goes through.

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:38.997
Joe Russo:
This is about a life cycle for
Cherry.

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:42.501
Anthony Russo:
It starts in a place of real
innocence and youthful idealism.

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:43.502
(Explosion) (Automatic gunfire)

00:00:43.502 --> 00:00:45.671
Anthony Russo:
And then it goes through the
experience of war,

00:00:45.671 --> 00:00:47.464
Anthony Russo:
P.T.S.D., drug addiction

00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:48.465
Anthony Russo:
and bank robbery.

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:51.009
(Gunshot)
Cherry:
Get on the ground now!

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:53.470
Cherry:
One thing about robbing banks,
is you're mostly robbing women,

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:55.472
Cherry:
So the last thing you want to
be is rude.

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:57.307
(Hammer-clicks)
Cherry:
Ma'am, it's nothing personal.

00:00:57.307 --> 00:00:58.809
♪♪

00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:01.520
Tom Holland:
The scale of what we've had to
do to create this character

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.313
and to create this arch for his
journey,

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:04.523
(Pill sound)
♪♪

00:01:04.523 --> 00:01:06.400
Tom Holland:
has been pretty daunting.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.194
Tom Holland lost almost a
quarter of his body weight

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:11.446
Joe Russo:
to achieve an incredible level
of realism.

00:01:11.446 --> 00:01:15.659
He sort of has this amazing
ability in terms of the looks he's able
to conjure.

00:01:15.659 --> 00:01:19.371
We go through 6 or 7
different looks that span 15
years.

00:01:19.371 --> 00:01:21.707
Because we're sort of dropping
into moments in time,

00:01:21.707 --> 00:01:25.794
Anthony Russo:
The interplay between those
phases, shredded Tom on an emotional level as well.

00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:27.170
(Mirror shatters)

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:28.714
I have this noise in my head.

00:01:28.714 --> 00:01:29.715
It'll stop.

00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:31.717
Emily:
One day it will just...

00:01:31.717 --> 00:01:32.718
Emily:
...Go quiet.

00:01:32.718 --> 00:01:36.430
♪♪

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:38.682
Anthony Russo:
Part of what was so fascinating
about this character, was that 

00:01:38.682 --> 00:01:41.685
Anthony Russo:
he started from a place of
sensitivity and vulnerability

00:01:41.685 --> 00:01:43.562
and then things just get worse.

00:01:43.562 --> 00:01:44.646
♪♪

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:48.525
What the Russo's have done is
incredibly cinematic. ♪♪

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:52.070
Tom Holland:
They even out high intensity
walks of life,

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:54.948
Tom Holland:
and slowly bring them together,
in a really, really nice way.

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:56.074
♪♪

00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:59.494
Ciara Bravo:
Chapter to chapter, Cherry's
journey feels undeniably real.

00:01:59.494 --> 00:02:00.495
(Thunder-Lightning)

00:02:00.495 --> 00:02:03.498
Anthony Russo:
It's incredibly intense, harrowing
and unpredictable.

00:02:03.498 --> 00:02:05.500
♪♪

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:06.501
(Rapid breathing)
♪♪

00:02:07.461 --> 00:02:08.462
Nooo!
♪♪

00:02:08.462 --> 00:02:09.713
♪♪

00:02:09.713 --> 00:02:11.131
It's kind of a role of a
lifetime.

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:12.132
♪♪

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:13.675
Tom Holland:
I can't wait for audiences to
just see

00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:15.510
this crazy, crazy story.

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:16.511
♪♪

00:02:16.511 --> 00:02:17.512
(Sirens wail)

00:02:17.512 --> 00:02:18.638
♪♪

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:21.391
Cherry:
Sometimes I feel like I've
already seen everything that's gonna happen.

00:02:21.391 --> 00:02:26.605
♪♪

00:02:26.605 --> 00:02:28.523
Cherry:
And it's a nightmare.

00:02:28.523 --> 00:02:35.489
♪♪

